  "prompt": "Open a DOSBox-X session from /opt/dosfury/fury.conf, working directory /opt/dosfury, bounded to 900 seconds, for somebody who is watching, its window on my main display. Keep its savestates in /opt/dosfury/states, and on the fresh session run the plan of one operation, reading the registers, waiting at most 12 seconds for a stop.",
